      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سلّس</span></b> , (Ibn-'Abbád,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْلِيسٌ</span>, (K,)
<i>He set, fixed,</i> or <i>put together,</i> a composite ornament, of the ornaments worn by women, not
consisting of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزَر</span> [or beads]. (Ibn-'Abbád, K, *
TA.)

